      "title": "Wabtec Q3 Earnings Beat on Margin Expansion, Revenues Miss",
      "summary": "Wabtec Corporation reported Q3 2026 earnings of $2.83 per share, beating consensus estimates by 4%, with revenues of $3.12 billion slightly missing expectations. The company raised its full-year 2026 earnings guidance to $10.85-$11.05 per share. Both Freight and Transit segments showed strong margin expansion (190 and 260 basis points respectively), driven by organic growth, acquisitions, and operational efficiencies. Total backlog reached $31.44 billion, up 22.9% year-over-year.",
